# CD_DISABLED_DURING_PR_CONSOLIDATION
#
# Production CD is intentionally disabled while the open pull-request backlog is
# consolidated. GitHub does not load workflow files with the `.disabled` suffix,
# so this file cannot be dispatched or grant deployment/OIDC permissions.
#
# Rebuild and review production CD after the consolidation is complete. The last
# runnable workflow remains available in Git history before commit 8276f7d.
name: Deploy Production (disabled)
